 second delete of the now-missing path is wrapped in `On error` too:
 undocumented, but hand-verified (docs/ledger/probes/files/FIL-75.vox)
 that deleting a file that is not there DOES set the error flag, a
 failure the generator can guarantee and a good `On error` leaf for
 exactly that reason. Probe: docs/ledger/probes/files/FIL-75.vox.)

