(--- The ledger's file leaves, batch C, 2026-10-05 -----------------------

 docs/ledger/files.md rows FIL-09, FIL-15, FIL-16, FIL-18, FIL-19,
 FIL-20, FIL-21, FIL-27, FIL-28, FIL-30, FIL-31, FIL-34, FIL-36, FIL-37,
 FIL-39, FIL-43, FIL-48, FIL-50. Same machinery as batches B to B3: the
 name allocator and assertion helpers from gen_buffers.vox, the D16 guard
 repeated in every leaf that builds a path, every path built from
 gen_scratch_flag, and every property read on a still-open handle.

 FIL-37 is not one leaf but a rule every leaf here follows: each `open`
 goes through 'gen file open in any order', so the clause order is drawn
 per open rather than fixed. Hand-verified against vox 0.4.15 before
 encoding; the probes are docs/ledger/probes/files/FIL-NN.vox, each
 recording what the compiler printed.)

