(A whole number with a drawn sign and a magnitude from 'gen extreme
 number', so i64's top and the 2^31 boundary turn up beside short and
 long random ones. Never `-0`: a zero magnitude stays unsigned, so a
 caller can read the sign of the result off its first character.)

